  "item_short_desc": "<p>Designed with reflective striping on the front, back, and sleeves, Rothco&rsquo;s Safety Reflective Rain Jacket enhances visibility while ensuring you stay protected from the elements. Crafted from heavyweight polyester/PVC material, the hi-vis jacket repels moisture effectively while keeping you dry in the rain. The snap-up front and sleeve closure offers comfort, convenience, and ease of use during wear. In addition, the ventilated back and underarms provide optimal cooling airflow.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
