  "description": "<p>Designed with reflective striping on the front, back, and sleeves, Rothco&rsquo;s Safety Reflective Rain Jacket enhances visibility while ensuring you stay protected from the elements. Crafted from heavyweight polyester/PVC material, the hi-vis jacket repels moisture effectively while keeping you dry in the rain. The snap-up front and sleeve closure offers comfort, convenience, and ease of use during wear. In addition, the ventilated back and underarms provide optimal cooling airflow. The detachable drawstring hood provides adjustable protection against the elements while the 2 front slash pockets offer additional storge for essentials. From a weekend trip to a day&rsquo;s work in harsh weather, the reflective rain is a must-have for high visibility safety in low light situations.</p>",
